{"slug":"deep_liq_persistence","doc":"A deep dislocation that has *persisted* rather than flashed.\n\n    Duration, which nothing else here measures. A single bar printing 15% below\n    the mean can be a wick, a bad print, or a thin-book air pocket that repairs\n    itself within the hour. A dislocation still standing three bars later has\n    been seen by the whole market and not bid back \u2014 the discount is real, and\n    the forced seller is still working.\n\n    This is the mirror image of `deep_liq_velocity`, which wants the drop to have\n    been *fast*. Fast arrival and persistent aftermath are independent: a crash\n    can repair instantly, and a slow bleed can sit at its lows for days.","tier":"measured","trusted":false,"trustedMinTrades":30,"evidence":{"btcKnown":{"return_pct":0.0,"max_dd_pct":0.0,"sharpe":0.0,"expectancy_r":0.0,"trades":0},"btcUnseen":{"return_pct":0.0,"max_dd_pct":0.0,"sharpe":0.0,"expectancy_r":0.0,"trades":0},"portfolioKnown":{"return_pct":4.03,"max_dd_pct":1.43,"sharpe":1.011,"expectancy_r":0.3774,"trades":3,"win_rate":100.0,"profit_factor":null,"fees_usd":0.04},"portfolioUnseen":{"return_pct":1.44,"max_dd_pct":0.97,"sharpe":1.001,"sortino":0.03,"expectancy_r":0.1357,"trades":3,"win_rate":100.0,"wins":3,"losses":0,"profit_factor":null,"fees_usd":0.04,"avg_win_usd":0.4856,"avg_loss_usd":0.0,"best_trade_pct":9.67,"worst_trade_pct":0.22,"avg_hold_bars":12.0},"sensitivityPassed":"0/5","sensitivityOf":5,"sensitivityDetail":[0.0984,0.2249,0.1357,0.1357,0.268],"doubleCostExpectancyR":0.1339,"doubleCostReturnPct":1.4,"crossAsset":{"ETH":0.0,"SOL":0.0,"splitB":0.1357},"survives":false,"failedOn":["BTC-only n=0 (judged on portfolio)","too few trades anywhere","Sens"]},"window":{"bars":17520,"barsUnseen":8760,"interval":"1h","days":730,"firstBar":"2024-08-31T08:00:00+00:00","lastBar":"2026-08-31T07:00:00+00:00","symbols":["BTC","ETH","SOL","BNB","XRP","DOGE","ADA","AVAX","LINK"],"feeBpsPerSide":6.0,"sizingPct":0.1,"leverage":1.0,"startEquity